  "body": "These are all issues where the reference implementation is either correct or, in the `ReadableByteStreamControllerPullInto` case, doesn't make a testable difference. (For the reference implementation we could test that it invokes the `view`'s `buffer` and `byteOffset` property getters only once, but that doesn't make sense for actual implementations because those must directly access the underlying slots.)",
